343672f486c63736487674c197dfd2a4f256/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1524.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1524","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1524.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/81cdfffcd86317dec05d7dfba407f93d96d91273/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1524.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a3495eb833b3f1f2096187c4b14884afc98b67a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8c75-m5rh-r2vp/GHSA-8c75-m5rh-r2vp.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1524.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87966/info.html","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/92476fa9ef5bbdf211d346519c4e7fa1edfdfea0/1999.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--8e32eab3-03e5-4ddc-bd4a-23a5766c069d.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1160.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0322","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0322.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0727","title":"OpenBSD 内核 IPsec 数据包未加密发送漏洞","description":"OpenBSD 内核存在资源泄漏漏洞，该漏洞导致 IPsec 安全协议的加密机制失效，使得本应加密传输的 IPsec 数据包能够以明文形式未经加密直接发送。攻击者可利用此漏洞绕过 IPsec 提供的数据传输加密保护，截获或监听本应受保护的网络通信内容，造成敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响运行 OpenBSD 系统且启用 IPsec 功能的设备，攻击条件为攻击者需位于网络传输路径上以截获未加密的数据包。OpenBSD 已在后续版本中修复此内核泄漏问题，建议用户及时升级系统版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0727"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-08-06T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:55Z","remediation":"升级至 OpenBSD 2.6 及以上版本，该版本修复了内核中 IPsec 处理流程的内存泄漏问题，确保所有 IPsec 数据包均被正确加密后发送。若无法升级，可临时禁用 IPsec 功能或使用 pf 防火墙限制相关流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/6127","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0f25967d744704fe14324ac10f2b57e945aed081/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0727.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2eb55660fa7a900eec90103b031be5d6f98d9ec/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0727.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0727","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0727.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0727.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/370723f19bf3029ced147d3128d845761f3168c3/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-07xx/CVE-1999-0727.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7ad5a0b8a6cc847a756fff84ffda27203e470e86/1999/CVE-1999-0727.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/490d6657aaeb62053fddc3213da299eb1e656f38/api/1999/CVE-1999-0727.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0727.json","https://github.com/justakazh/CVE_Database/blob/06bd07f32c89b43f30d59ff450dfbb661e471cbe/1999/CVE-1999-0727.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0322.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0239","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0239.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0682","title":"Microsoft Exchange Server 5.5 邮件中继绕过漏洞","description":"Microsoft Exchange Server 5.5 存在邮件中继绕过漏洞，远程攻击者可通过封装 SMTP 地址的方式绕过反中继功能限制，利用该服务器转发垃圾邮件，导致服务器被滥用为垃圾邮件中继站。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0682"],"sources":["cve","nvd"],"published":"1999-08-06T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"应用 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-027 提供的补丁，或升级到不再受此漏洞影响的 Exchange 版本。由于 Exchange 5.5 已停止支持，建议迁移到受支持的 Exchange 版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T17:45:47Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-027","http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ237927","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/567"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0239.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0319","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0319.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0719","title":"GNOME Gnumeric Guile 插件代码执行漏洞","description":"Gnumeric 电子表格中的 Guile 插件（基于 GNU Guile 脚本引擎扩展）存在代码执行漏洞。攻击者可通过构造特制的 Gnumeric 工作簿文件，诱骗用户打开后触发插件对恶意脚本的不安全处理，导致任意代码在用户权限下执行。该漏洞影响 Gnumeric 受影响版本，攻击需用户交互，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0719"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"1999-08-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:54Z","remediation":"将 Gnumeric 升级至 0.50 或更高版本，该版本已为 Guile 插件添加安全沙箱机制，限制 Scheme 扩展代码的权限范围，防止任意代码执行。如无法升级，可删除或重命名 plugins/guile 目录以禁用 Guile 插件作为临时缓解措施。对于仍在使用的老旧发行版，建议迁移至仍受支持的发行版并安装最新 Gnumeric 版本（如 1.12.x）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/563","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0719.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0719","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-1999-0719.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0719.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2m6f-mg5g-38jv/GHSA-2m6f-mg5g-38jv.json"